From: handsomeXiaowang <36980157+handsomeXiaowang@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:58:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Chinese localization and localize UI option choices

- Add zh locale tables (340+ strings) across 12 locales.py files
- Add translator.localize_choices() mapping raw values to display labels
- Wrap ~45 UI component choices with localize_choices() as (label, value) tuples
- Extend Language type to include zh and set CURRENT_LANGUAGE to zh
- Localize processor names, mask regions, presets, strategies, model names
- Translate all 157 deep_swapper celebrity models via base-name normalization
- Ignore venv directory

Backend logic and CLI keep receiving raw English identifiers; only the UI
layer renders localized labels.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
